<title>NETHERLANDS: GOLDMAN RATES UNILEVER OUTPERFORMER.</title>
<headline>GOLDMAN RATES UNILEVER OUTPERFORMER.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Aug 16 research.</p>
<p>Company-------Sector----------- Price---Broker--------------</p>
<p>Unilever	Food/detergents   Dfl 241 Goldman Sachs </p>
<p>COMMENT: Recommended list (reiterated) - Solid second</p>
<p>quarter results. Europe still flat but restructuring benefits</p>
<p>continue help earnings. Good momentum in North America and rapid</p>
<p>growth in developing markets. More effective organisational</p>
<p>structure nearly in place and more agressive return-oriented</p>
<p>management likely to emerge. Expect accelerating portfolio</p>
<p>change and more rapid shift to emerging markets. Consider U.K.'s</p>
<p>Plc shares if you have a medium-long-term view.</p>
<p>    Estimates (Dfl):   EPS (Dfl)     P/ E	Dividend</p>
<p>    1995 (actual)	13.30	   18. 1     6.20</p>
<p>    1996		   14.90	   16.1	7.00</p>
<p>    1997		   16.90	   14.2	7.80</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
